<section class="app-panel">
  <span class="eyebrow">Your scores</span>
  <h1>Write music, keep it</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Scores engraved as you type, played with real instruments, and saved to your account. Sign-in and your
    library come next; until then the <a href="<%= playground_path() %>">playground</a> keeps a draft in this
    browser.
  </p>
</section>
